@startuml

node "Office Laptop" {
  [Fee Management Application]
  database "SQLite Database"
}

node "Printer" {
  [Receipt Printing]
}

node "WiFi Connection" {
  [Backup Sync]
}

[Fee Management Application] --> [Receipt Printing] : USB/Cable
[Fee Management Application] --> [Backup Sync] : WiFi available most days

note right
Works when WiFi is down:
- Record payments
- View student records
- Print receipts
- Calculate balances

Data stored locally in SQLite.
end note

@enduml